# Line-ending policy lives in the repository, not in each machine's
# core.autocrlf. Text fixtures are exempted from conversion because the
# manifest and the ingest checksum gate hash raw bytes: with conversion, one
# commit checks out with different SHA-256 on the Windows and Linux CI legs
# (#1, #3, #4).
* text=auto
tests/data/** -text
docs/data/** -text
*.xlsx binary
*.npy binary
